Modifications: the files were modified. SKILL.md was written fresh in the
house style, with routing to java-testing, spring-boot and unit-testing. The
upstream references were merged and condensed into six references plus the
Boot 4 migration notes. The awesome-copilot assertj, instancio, code-complexity
and "80% coverage minimum" material was dropped. Facts were rechecked against
docs.spring.io (Spring Boot and Spring Framework testing references), the
Spring Boot 4.0 migration guide and Maven Central on 2026-10-20. Fixes on
port: @MockBean and @SpyBean are removed in Boot 4, not only deprecated;
MockMvcTester arrived with Spring Framework 6.2 (Boot 3.4), not Boot 3.2; a
mocked prototype or scoped bean becomes a singleton mock rather than "now
works"; Boot 4 no longer registers TestRestTemplate or WebTestClient beans in
@SpringBootTest; Testcontainers 2 modules are named testcontainers-<module>;
the servlet OIDC post-processor is oidcLogin(), while mockOidcLogin() is the
WebFlux name.
